# The report bucket uses S3's own encryption (SSE-S3). A customer managed KMS key would
# cost money each month, which isn't worth it for a bucket that only holds cost reports.
AVD-AWS-0132

# ec2:Describe* calls can't be limited to single resources, so the read-only EC2 statement
# has to use "*". The write permissions are all scoped to one bucket folder and one log group.
AVD-AWS-0057
